      "content": "That feeling of being hollow while still performing life is a deeply unsettling and painful experience, and it is absolutely not strange to feel that way. It suggests a deep disconnect between your outward presentation and your internal experience. You might be experiencing a period of profound emotional numbness or depletion, which can make everything feel like autopilot. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you explore this feeling of emptiness.",
      "source": "target",
